    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n27680" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">mălăcisso</span></b> , 1,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>v a.</i>, =
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μαλακίζω</span>, <i>to</i>
			
			<i>render soft</i> or <i>supple, to
				soften, make pliable</i> (ante-class. and post-Aug.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">malacissandus es,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plaut. Bacch. 1, 1, 31</span></i>
			: articulos, v. l. <i><span class="en">Sen. Ep.
				66, 53</span></i> dub. (Haase, malaxandos).</div>
